Chu Ying was a little confused: "Brother, you are so powerful, can't we just stay at home?"
Chu Yuan didn't take it seriously and said, "There are many people in the Suppression and Military Bureau and the military who are better than me. Chenyang City has not become like this."
If you go to a crowded place and say something ugly, at least you will have some shields.
But when he arrived at Dafeng Shopping Mall, Chu Yuan's heart became cold again;
The shelter in Dafeng Shopping Mall is located underground. When danger comes, of course Chu Yuan is not the only one who can think of this place.
Looking at the messy footprints on the ground and the piled-up vehicles on the roadside, one can imagine that many smarter people have already run in beforehand;
but something is wrong
There is a cold energy wandering nearby! It made him feel like he had a light on his back;
Chu Yuan could feel that the source of this energy was underground in Dafeng Mall!
If you listen carefully, you can't even hear the human voice inside.
"Mom, you guys hide here for a while." Chu Yuan violently opened a car door and let Han Cui and Chu Ying in;
Then he flashed again and rushed towards the interior of the mall!
Chu Ying's eyes followed his steps until Chu Yuan completely disappeared in the mall;
She raised her wrist and looked at the terminal with no signal. She was about to say something to relieve her tension when she suddenly saw Chu Yuan jumping out like a chased rabbit!
"Brother!"
"Let's go!"
Chu Yuan stopped in front of the car and opened the door;
"Why so fast?"
But she saw that Chu Yuan ignored her at all, but looked in the direction of the shopping mall with a solemn expression.
Chu Ying followed and looked and saw a woman walking out as if she was floating!
She has a delicate face, but her eyes are empty, and there is a weird smile on the corner of her mouth.
Han Cui obviously recognized this thing, her expression changed drastically, and she quickly covered Chu Ying's eyes, "Don't look! Let's go!"
Chu Yuan was anxious, he had known that he would not come to the shelter;
The first time he entered the mall, he saw numerous dead bodies!
There were no external injuries on their bodies, as if they were just sleeping, but they were not breathing at all;
Then there was a burst of crying, and a strand of hair fell to his shoulders.
Chu Yuan has heard of this thing, it’s called weird, which is also the ‘ghost’ in folklore!
Their origins are a mystery, but they are also the hostile camp of the human race! Loves to devour human souls!
They are rare in quantity and can be extremely difficult to handle!
Ordinary attacks have no way to deal with them. Only energy attacks with attached attributes or spiritual attacks can harm them;
But those things are not something that low-level warriors can master.
Yan Xuan and his group are eyeing the essence of flesh and blood, and these weird things are eyeing the souls of the people in Chenyang City. You really don't waste any of it!
Chu Yuan complained secretly in his heart, but did not dare to relax;
"Brother! Come on!"
Chu Ying seemed to be shouting, and Chu Yuan turned around subconsciously, only to meet a pair of dark pupils;
The resentment inside was almost solidified, impacting Chu Yuan's will like a tide!
Chu Yuan reacted very quickly, and instantly mobilized his spiritual power to flood his mind, and then he felt a burst of clarity;
Immediately and decisively slashed away!
The cold light flashed and struck her neck, as if it was struck on a stone. Chu Yuan's wrist was numb from the shock;
The blade was halfway in, and a few drops of thick black blood flowed out.
